  "title": "Everyone against everyone – feint and dribble past",
  "description": "Everyone has a ball and moves freely inside a box of about 10 × 10 metres. When you meet a team-mate you take them on, make a feint and dribble past – but nobody may take or knock the ball away from anyone else. Then you carry on with your own ball and look for the next one to take on.\n\nProgression: carry the ball with only one hand on the stick. The diagram is not to scale.",
